Source: glbx-pkcs11-forward
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Garden Linux <contact@gardenlinux.io>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), gcc, libprotobuf-c-dev, protobuf-c-compiler, libp11-kit-dev
Standards-Version: 4.6.2

Package: glbx-pkcs11-forward
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: PKCS#11 module forwarding signing operations to a host service
 A PKCS#11 provider module that holds no key and performs no cryptography.
 It presents a single token and key to the loading application and forwards
 every public-key query and signing operation over a Unix socket to a signing
 service running outside the build, so signing can happen without the private
 key ever being present where the module runs.
